\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 Thi h\'e0nh ph\'e1p l\u7879\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa h\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ng\'e0y 17-11-1987 v\'e0 ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng b
\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng s\u7889\'3f/ H\'d0BT ng\'e0y 30-1-1988 b\u7893\'3f xung,  s\u7917\'3fa \'f0\u7893\'3fi m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f \'f0i\u7873\'3fu v\u7873\'3f thu\u7871\'3f c\'f4ng th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 v
