\par }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 Khi t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc theo c\'e1c thu\u7871\'3f su\u7845\'3ft lu\u7929\'3f ti\u7871\'3fn t\u7915\'3fng ph\u7847\'3fn c\u7847\'3fn tham kh\u7843\'3fo v\'e0 \'f0\u7889\'3fi chi
\u7871\'3fu v\u7899\'3fi b\u7843\'3fng h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\'e1ch t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc theo bi\u7875\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f lu\u7929\'3f ti\u7871\'3fn t\u7915\'3fng ph\u7847\'3fn, k\'e8m theo th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.

\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 4. }{\f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 T\'ednh gi\u7843\'3fm thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633  
