\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc h\u7907\'3fp t\'e1c x}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'e3 c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c ng\'e0nh ban h\'e0nh v\'e0 c\'e1c v}{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'e3n b\u7843\'3fn h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3f
n kh\'e1c c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, ho\u7863\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan ch\u7913\'3fc n\'e3ng c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par c.) Vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc \'f0\u7897\'3f quan h\u7879\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng theo c\'f4ng th\u7913\'3fc sau:
