\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 quan h\u7879\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\sb120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx1251\tx1971\tx2691\tx3411\tx4131\tx4851\tx5571\tx6291\tx7011\tx7731\tx8451\tx9171\tx9891\tx10611\tx11331\tx12051\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 
