\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633  T\u7893\'3fng s\u7889\'3f quan h\u7879\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f
\par Quan h\u7879\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \u7903\'3f \'f0\'e2y ch\u7881\'3f  t\'ednh ph\u7847\'3fn quan h\u7879\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh c\'f3 ch\u7913
\'3fc n\'e3ng s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft, kinh doanh lo\u7841\'3fi h\'e0ng ho\'e1 hay lo\u7841\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm \'f0\'f3 (k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa c\u7843\'3f qu\'e2n \'f0\u7897\'3f
i). Ri\'eang \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f v\u7853\'3fn t\u7843\'3fi v\'e0 x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'ec t\'ednh c\u7843\'3f ph\u7847\'3fn quan h\u7879\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3f
i c\'e1c }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f  kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh v\'e0 c\'e1c c\'f5 quan, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc. Khi x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\'f3 quan h\u7879
\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\u7843\'3fi c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f c\'f3 duy\u7879\'3ft gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn.
\par Tu\u7923\'3f theo \'f0\u7863\'3fc \'f0i\u7875\'3fm \u7903\'3f t\u7915\'3fng n\'f5i v\'e0 t\'ednh ch\u7845\'3ft s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f, c\'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f \'e1p d\u7909
\'3fng ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau hi\u7879\'3fn v\u7853\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f t\'ednh m\u7913\'3fc \'f0\u7897\'3f quan h\u7879\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc; nh\'fdng \'e1p d\u7909
\'3fng ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau n\'e0o c\u361\'3fng ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo t\'ednh \'f0\u7891\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f so s\'e1nh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc.}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid5648192 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\keepn\widctlpar\tx1251\tx1971\tx2691\tx3411\tx4131\tx4851\tx5571\tx6291\tx7011\tx7731\tx8451\tx9171\tx9891\tx10611\tx11331\tx12051\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5141683 {
