\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 th\u7883\'3ft, v\u7899\'3fi thu\u7871\'3f su\u7845\'3ft l\'e0 10 % tr\'ean tr\u7883\'3f gi\'e1 con v\u7853\'3ft gi\u7871\'3ft th\u7883\'3ft, t\'ednh theo th\u7901\'3fi gi\'e1. C\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f nh
\'fd sau:
\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 1. }{\f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 Ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f s\'e1t sinh}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633  :
