i l}{\f114\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'fd b\'e1n l\u7867\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc u\u7927\'3f th\'e1c thu mua \'f0}{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp; c\'e1c tr\'fd
\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp mua \'f0\u7913\'3ft b\'e1n \'f0o\u7841\'3fn theo gi\'e1 tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'ec }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f0\u7873\'3fu coi l\'e0 doanh thu t
\u7921\'3f }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 kinh doanh ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par   - N\u7897\'3fp 30% s\u7889\'3f th\u7921\'3fc l\'e3i v\'e0o ng\'e2n s\'e1ch.
\par }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633   - HTX mua b\'e1n, HTX ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f \'f0i mua h\'e0ng v\u7873\'3f b\'e1n cho nh\'e2n d\'e2n \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'ec kh\'f4ng coi l\'e0
 bu\'f4n chuy\u7871\'3fn v\'e0 kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f bu\'f4n chuy\u7871\'3fn. N\u7871\'3fu kinh doanh c\'f3 t\'ednh ch\u7845\'3ft bu\'f4n chuy\u7871\'3fn th\'ec ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f bu\'f4n chuy\u7871\'3fn.

\par   H\u7907\'3fp t\'e1c x\'e3 ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c c}{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f5 quan, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp c\'f4ng n\'f4ng l\'e2m tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng n\u7871\'3fu ch\u7881\'3f l\'e0m c
\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc c\'e3ng tin (nh\'fd mua h\u7897\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 theo ti\'eau chu\u7849\'3fn cho c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, c\'f4ng nh\'e2n vi\'ean; mua h\'e0ng v\u7873\'3f b\'e1n cho c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f trong c\'f5 quan, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f) ho\u7863
\'3fc t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc c\'e1c b\u7871\'3fp \'e3n t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f b\u7919\'3fa \'e3n tr\'fda cho c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, b\u7919\'3fa \'e3n gi\u7919\'3fa ca cho c\'f4ng nh\'e2n trong \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f; ho\u7863
\'3fc ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f kh\'e1ch \'f0\u7871\'3fn l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'ec kh\'f4ng coi l\'e0 kinh doanh v\'e0 kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f. N\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 ho\u7841\'3ft }
{\f114\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f0\u7897\'3fng kinh doanh mang t\'ednh ch\u7845\'3ft t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f; c}{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f4ng nh\'e2n vi\'ean trong \'f0\'f5
n v\u7883\'3f th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'ec ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi thu\u7871\'3f theo quy }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 3 d\'fd\u7899
\'3fi \'f0\'e2y.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633  2. }{\f122\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 C\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7907\'3fp doanh chia l}{\f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'e3i:
\par }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633   a) \'d0\'fd\u7907\'3fc coi l\'e0 c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7907\'3fp doanh \'f0\u7875\'3f \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng thu thu\u7871\'3f theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 12 Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0
\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa H\'d0BT s\u7889\'3f  ng\'e0y 30/1/1988 l\'e0: C\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh c\'e1c HTX mua b\'e1n t\u7915\'3f qu\u7853\'3fn, huy\u7879\'3fn tr\u7903\'3f l\'ean, c\'f3 ch\u7913\'3fc n\'e3
ng s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh (bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa l\u7921\'3fc l\'fd\u7907\'3fng v\u361\'3f trang) li\'ean doanh ho\u7863\'3fc h\u7907\'3fp t\'e1c kinh doanh v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s
\u7903\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc t\'fd nh\'e2n, c\'e1 th\u7875\'3f.
\par   b) C\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp kh\'e1c \'f0\u7873\'3fu c}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 oi l\'e0 t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc kinh t\u7871\'3f t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f; n\u7871\'3fu kinh doanh ng\'e0nh n\'e0y ph\u7909\'3fc v
\u7909\'3f th\'ec thu thu\u7871\'3f nh}{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'fd \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7907\'3fp doanh chia l}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'e3i, nh}{
\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'fdng kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fm 10% s\u7889\'3f thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc. N\u7871\'3fu kinh doanh ng\'e0nh th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, \'e3n u\u7889\'3fng th}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'ec coi l\'e0 n\'fap d}{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'fd\u7899\'3fi danh ngh\u297\'3fa c\'f5 quan \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f, kh\'f4ng l\'e0m \'f0\'fang ch\'ednh s\'e1ch, v\'e0 ph\u7843\'3f
i thu thu\u7871\'3f nh\'fd \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi h\u7897\'3f t\'fd nh\'e2n, c\'e1 th\u7875\'3f.
\par  3. C\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp, c\'f4ng, n\'f4ng l\'e2m tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng ngo\'e0i ph\u7847\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ch\'ednh, s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ph\u7909\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc qu\u7843\'3fn l}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'fd t\'e0i  ch\'ednh theo ch\u7871\'3f }{\f114\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f0\u7897\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh, n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn s\u7843
\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh mang t\'ednh ch\u7845\'3f}{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 t t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f c\'f4ng nh\'e2n vi\'ean trong \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f, c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kh\'e1
c g\u7891\'3fm c\'f5 quan Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, c\'f5 quan \'d0\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f, m\u7863\'3ft tr\u7853\'3fn, c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp kh\'f4ng c\'f3 ch\u7913\'3fc n\'e3ng s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3f
t kinh doanh nh\'fdng c\'f3 t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh \'f0\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3fi thi\u7879\'3fn \'f0\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3fng cho CBCNV trong \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f ( x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp 
\'f0\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3fng) th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'ec ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f nh}{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'fd sau:
\par - N\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 n\u7871\'3fu s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft c\'e1c m\u7863\'3ft h\'e0ng c\'f3 ghi trong danh m\u7909\'3fc c\'e1c m\u7863\'3ft h\'e0ng ch\u7883\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 theo \'f0i\u7873\'3fu l\u7879\'3f thu
\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 - N\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f s\'e1t sinh, n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 gi\u7871\'3ft m\u7893\'3f l\u7907\'3fn, tr\'e2u, b\'f2.
\par - }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 N\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp theo thu\u7871\'3f su\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi t\u7915\'3fng m\u7863\'3ft h\'e0ng ghi trong bi\u7875\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f doanh nghi\u7879
\'3fp, tr\'ean ph\u7847\'3fn doanh thu b\'e1n h\'e0ng ho\u7863\'3fc doanh thu gia c\'f4ng, ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f ( kh\'f4ng thu thu\u7871\'3f doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0o ph\u7847\'3fn doanh thu b\'e1n th\u7883\'3ft l\u7907\'3fn, tr\'e2u, b}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f2 }{\f114\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'e3 n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f s\'e1t sinh.
\par - Kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 - N\u7871\'3fu kinh doanh \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng d\'e0i c\'f3 t\'ednh ch\u7845\'3ft bu\'f4n chuy\u7871\'3fn th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'ec ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f
 bu\'f4n chuy\u7871\'3fn.   
\par }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633    Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y thay th\u7871\'3f cho th\'f4ng t\'fd s\u7889\'3f 10 - TC/CTN ng\'e0y 30/3/1983 c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i Ch\'ednh v\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn tr\'fd
\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'e2y c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i Ch\'ednh v\u7873\'3f thu\u7871\'3f CTN, thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1, thu\u7871\'3f s\'e1t sinh, tr\'e1i v\u7899\'3fi th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y, \'f0\u7873\'3fu b}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'e3i b\u7887\'3f.
\par }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 Trong qu\'e1 t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn, n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 kh\'f3 kh\'e3n, v\'fd\u7899\'3fng m\u7855\'3fc ho\u7863\'3fc c\'f3 \'f0i\u7875\'3fm n\'e0o ch\'fda r}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f5, }{\f122\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\'e1c ng\'e0nh, c\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi ph\u7843\'3fn \'e1nh v\u7873\'3f B\u7897
\'3f T\'e0i Ch\'ednh \'f0\u7875\'3f nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu, h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn th\'eam.}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid7040147\charrsid4738633 
